        <reqCondGroup><reqCondNoRef><reqCond>Tank düz zeminde, motor durdurulmuş, park freni çekili.</reqCond></reqCondNoRef><reqCondNoRef><reqCond>Kule kilitli.</reqCond></reqCondNoRef></reqCondGroup>
